Device layer for the OnePlus Ace Pro / OnePlus 10T (pgp110, Cape / SM8475).

Two license categories apply to this repository:

1. Our own code in this device layer — the device configuration, the SoC fact
   tables, the UEFI platform package sources, the porting scripts and the
   documentation — is licensed under the MIT License below.

2. Third-party components carry their own licenses; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
   In particular:
   - UEFI platform package sources derived from Project Mu / Mu-Silicium are
     BSD-2-Clause-Patent, as marked in their file headers.
   - prebuilt/mkbootimg.py is the Android Open Source Project tool under the
     Apache License 2.0.

The phone's own firmware (GPU, Wi-Fi, modem, audio, haptics, camera), vendor
UEFI driver binaries, the Apple IPSW / Darwin userland and Apple trademarks
are NOT part of this repository and are not licensed by it. Each user obtains
those from their own device and their own copy of the firmware.

